ized usable capacity, price-change frequency, <code>=C2=A3/available-kW</co=
de>, reliability-adjusted coverage, operator/site quality, and local capaci=
ty pressure. Join traffic/POIs, planning, EV adoption, electricity/grid con=
straints and operator/company identity.</p>
